$MDESC::Type = "Ski Maps";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Tribes Racer" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Halcyon X" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Dusk" @ 
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> Race through rings of fire as the sun sets.  This map is for extremely skilled Racers only.  At times you will be required to invert your craft and fly through the smallest of spaces.  There are many secrets hidden within this map.  None are easy to figure out.  The first player to reach 10 laps will be the victor! \n\n<f1>Map by: <f2>Nathan Sweet aka [HvC]NaTeDoGG<f1>, creator of Tribes Racer and the HaVoC mod.\n\n<f2>http://havoc.sirris.com";
